							<span class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-200 whitespace-nowrap">Blender</span>
						</div>
						<div class="group relative flex flex-col items-center justify-end px-6 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300">
